# odin-htmx-starter: the repo root. This workspace becomes the renamed repo's checkout at M0 (ANSWERS #5, F5), so
# this file replaces the skeleton's root .gitignore and carries its entries (the second block).

# Local-only planning material (ANSWERS F4; D45). The repo is public:
# - docs/private/ holds the real site values behind the public docs' placeholders (docs/private/SITE.md);
# - the research notes, the three proposals and the outline name LAN and host details and are superseded by
#   DECISIONS.md and PLAN.md, which cite them in place;
# - _ref/ is a read-only reference clone of the skeleton at 709bc94, removed at M0.
/docs/private/
/docs/research/
/docs/design/proposal-*.md
/docs/design/OUTLINE.md
/_ref/

# From the skeleton's root .gitignore (709bc94).
# Build artifacts and fetched deps under app/ are ignored by app/.gitignore.
# This file covers the repo as a whole.

# Load-test output
load-tests/results/

# Logs and OS / editor cruft
*.log
